From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:35:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] Bravery: fix startup crash and tap to scroll on Android
 15+

- Attach per-tab helpers once the WebContents is initialized. The view is
  created first, and SelectionPopupController.fromWebContents asserted there.
- Record taps on ACTION_DOWN. Content transfers the rest of the gesture to
  viz on Android 15+, so the view only sees ACTION_CANCEL.
- Scroll on taps a page cancels (e.g. preventDefault on mouseup) unless they
  land on something interactive, checked in the isolated world.
- Use the top and bottom halves as scroll zones.
---
