 .../browser/bravery/BraveryController.java    | 20 +++++-
 .../browser/bravery/BraveryTapToScroll.java   | 63 ++++++++++---------
 .../android/bravery/bravery_banner_hider.js   | 33 ++++++++++
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

